{"availability":"available","full":"noumansarwarr/interactive-product-demo","name":"interactive-product-demo","description":"Claude Code skill that builds animated landing-page product demos from live DOM/CSS instead of video or GIF — scripted cursor, camera pans, spotlights. React + TypeScript.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-13T18:05:07Z","updated":"2026-10-01T18:48:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["agent-skills","claude-code","claude-skill","claude-skills","css-animation","hero-animation","interactive-demo","landing-page","product-demo","react","typescript","video-alternative"],"demo":"https://claude.com/claude-code","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:57.309Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:57.309Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:57.309Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:07:57.309Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](LICENSE) [](CHANGELOG.md) []( [](#requirements)","Interactive Product Demo is an open-source Claude Code skill that builds a landing-page product demo out of live DOM and CSS instead of a screen recording. It replicates a screen of your React app with your own components, then animates a scripted cursor and a panning, spotlighting camera through one task. No video, GIF, Lottie, or canvas. It adds about 40 KB of plain TypeScript and CSS source and no runtime dependencies.","In short: a code-based, auto-playing alternative to a hero video, a Loom, or an animated GIF of your UI. Text stays sharp, layout stays responsive, and when your product changes, the TypeScript compiler tells you the demo needs updating."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/noumansarwarr/interactive-product-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e6b7616cee001deb1a42bbee4f9a93c5d71506456880a7b5aa0c5299b7214c6e","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:57.428Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-